    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added a video compatibility option for Android, enabled by default to improve playback compatibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;中文&lt;/h3&gt;
