  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1277041207/v1.4.5-nightly.20260910.3cbe5e2</id>
    <updated>2026-09-10T03:44:17Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/iebb/mithka/releases/tag/v1.4.5-nightly.20260910.3cbe5e2"/>
    <title>v1.4.5 Nightly 2026-09-10 (3cbe5e2)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved unread message scrolling so you can jump to unread items more reliably in chats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Android media handling for smoother image and video playback in chat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolved download ownership issues so downloaded files are attributed correctly and open more reliably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refined chat media previews, transcripts, and moments viewing for a smoother experience when browsing shared content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;中文&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;改进了未读消息滚动，让你可以更可靠地在聊天中跳转到未读内容。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;修复了 Android 上的媒体处理问题，使聊天中的图片和视频播放更顺畅。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;解决了下载文件归属问题，确保已下载文件能正确归属并更稳定地打开。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;优化了聊天媒体预览、转录内容和动态查看体验，让浏览共享内容时更顺畅。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full changelog:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/iebb/mithka/compare/v1.4.4-nightly.20260909.38227de...v1.4.5-nightly.20260910.3cbe5e2&quot;&gt;v1.4.4-nightly.20260909.38227de...v1.4.5-nightly.20260910.3cbe5e2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
