  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1277041207/v1.4.3-nightly.20260908.2819215</id>
    <updated>2026-09-08T03:42:23Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/iebb/mithka/releases/tag/v1.4.3-nightly.20260908.2819215"/>
    <title>v1.4.3 Nightly 2026-09-08 (2819215)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved topic navigation and pane layout for clearer conversation browsing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed unread message positioning in topic chats so new content stays easier to find.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refined chat and tab interactions for smoother switching between conversations and app sections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added fuller image and video viewing with fullscreen support and media gestures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated chat and media screens for more reliable viewing and a cleaner full-screen experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;中文&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;优化了主题导航和面板布局，使会话浏览更加清晰。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;修复了主题聊天中的未读消息定位问题，使新内容更容易找到。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;优化了聊天和标签页交互，提升了在会话和应用分区之间切换的流畅度。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;增强了图片和视频查看体验，增加了全屏支持和媒体手势操作。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;更新了聊天和媒体界面，提升了查看稳定性，并提供更清晰的全屏体验。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full changelog:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/iebb/mithka/compare/v1.4.2-nightly.20260907.7c6b624...v1.4.3-nightly.20260908.2819215&quot;&gt;v1.4.2-nightly.20260907.7c6b624...v1.4.3-nightly.20260908.2819215&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
