  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1277041207/v1.4.2-nightly.20260907.7c6b624</id>
    <updated>2026-09-07T03:30:21Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/iebb/mithka/releases/tag/v1.4.2-nightly.20260907.7c6b624"/>
    <title>v1.4.2 Nightly 2026-09-07 (7c6b624)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;App lock now tries biometric authentication before showing the passcode screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux AppImages are now available with verified in-app updates restricted to Mithka’s own runtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unread indicators for mentions and reactions now update correctly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;中文&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;应用锁现在会先尝试生物识别认证，再显示密码界面。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;现已提供 Linux AppImage，并支持经过验证的应用内更新，且更新仅限于 Mithka 自身运行时。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;提及和回应的未读指示器现在可以正确更新。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full changelog:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/iebb/mithka/compare/v1.4.1-nightly.20260906.a243cae...v1.4.2-nightly.20260907.7c6b624&quot;&gt;v1.4.1-nightly.20260906.a243cae...v1.4.2-nightly.20260907.7c6b624&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
